; bal -X EUR --unrealized keeps the revaluation between postings when an
; --account-rewrite or --payee-rewrite option, rather than a directive,
; gives the rewrite rule: rewrite_posts copies the rewritten posting into a
; transaction of its own, dated by the posting, whichever gives the rule,
; so the report must not value the costs at the transaction's date.  The
; journal is that of unrealized-footing-posting-date.test; the output is
; that of unrealized-account-rewrite.test and unrealized-payee-rewrite.test,
; which give the same rules by directive.

P 2024/01/01 $ 0.90 EUR
P 2024/01/10 $ 0.80 EUR

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150  ; [2024/01/15]
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/05 AAPL $170

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --account-rewrite Brokerage=Assets:Broker
           EUR160.00  Assets
          EUR1360.00    Broker
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --payee-rewrite Buy=Purchase
           EUR160.00  Assets
          EUR1360.00    Brokerage
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test
